  "kind": "pattern",
  "name": {
    "zh-CN": "适配器",
    "en-US": "Adapter"
  },
  "aliases": [
    "Adapter",
    "适配器模式",
    "adapter pattern"
  ],
  "category": "structural",
  "status": "DOCUMENTED",
  "intent": "在不修改既有接口的前提下，把一个类的接口转换成调用方期望的接口。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "interface_mismatch": "true",
      "existing_interface": "must_not_change",
      "adaptation_direction": "target_defines_contract",
      "delegation": "prefer_delegation_over_inheritance"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "两个接口本就可以统一设计时，改接口比加适配器更省事",
      "只需要转换一个值或一段参数时，写一个转换函数比写适配器类更轻"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.gof.structural.facade",
      "pattern.gof.structural.bridge"
    ]
  },
